---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Data deletion instructions"
  description="How to request deletion of information associated with US5 Incorporation correspondence or products."
  path="/data-deletion/"
  updated="28 August 2026"
  ><h2>Website correspondence</h2><p>
    The website itself does not store form submissions. If you sent an enquiry by email and want
    related correspondence reviewed for deletion, email <a
      href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}?subject=Data%20deletion%20request`}>{siteConfig.email}</a
    > with the subject “Data deletion request.”
  </p><h2>What to include</h2><p>
    Provide the email address used, approximate date, and enough context to locate the
    correspondence. Do not include passwords or sensitive credentials. We may need to verify that
    you control the relevant email address.
  </p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>
    We will review the request and explain the action taken. Some information may need to be
    retained where reasonably necessary for security, legal obligations, dispute resolution, or
    legitimate record keeping.
  </p><h2>Future mobile products</h2><p>
    Each public product will provide product-specific deletion instructions reflecting its actual
    accounts, data, and service providers. No mobile product is currently published on this website.
  </p></LegalLayout
>
